<p>See the full <a href="/nielsen-media-impact/alternatives">Nielsen Media Impact alternatives</a> page for a broader comparison.</p>

<h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>

<h3>Does Nielsen Media Impact publish pricing?</h3>
<p>No. Nielsen Media Impact is custom-quoted by Nielsen.</p>

<h3>What affects Nielsen Media Impact pricing?</h3>
<p>Markets, users, channels, audience segments, Nielsen data access, modules, and bundled Nielsen products are likely pricing drivers.</p>

<h3>Is Nielsen Media Impact a buying platform?</h3>
<p>No. It is primarily a planning and analytics platform for reach, frequency, and scenario modeling.</p>

<h3>Does it include advanced audience segments?</h3>
<p>Nielsen has introduced Scarborough-powered advanced audience segments within Nielsen ONE workflows. Confirm availability for your specific Media Impact package.</p>

<h3>How does it compare with Commspoint Journey?</h3>
<p>Media Impact focuses on reach and frequency planning. Commspoint Journey focuses on consumer decision journeys and touchpoint influence.</p>

